WEBVTT

01:26.080 --> 01:31.640
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.509
[Episode 10: Bloodbath to Protect the Raw Silk]

01:41.090 --> 01:44.940
[Three days ago, Yangzhou]

01:56.710 --> 01:58.416
You know how to wash your clothes too?

01:58.440 --> 01:59.696
I'm not familiar with the servants here.

01:59.720 --> 02:00.836
I'm not comfortable letting others wash my clothes.

02:00.860 --> 02:02.780
We've left home. Why are you still so particular?

02:02.880 --> 02:06.066
It's just a few inches of shabby cloth to protect from the cold.

02:06.090 --> 02:07.376
The rest is,

02:07.400 --> 02:08.910
but this one is different.

02:10.880 --> 02:11.906
Let me see.

02:11.930 --> 02:14.536
Is it made of gold?

02:14.560 --> 02:15.736
Gold?

02:15.760 --> 02:17.870
How can gold compare to this Yulan magnolia?

02:18.280 --> 02:21.136
You are a sir and yet wear these flowers and weeds.

02:21.160 --> 02:22.920
You don't understand this.

02:23.230 --> 02:24.676
Take the last words of our names, Su Mingyu and Ke Menglan,

02:24.700 --> 02:26.976
and you get this flower, Yulan magnolia.

02:27.000 --> 02:29.080
Miss Menglan gave this to me.

02:29.480 --> 02:30.606
Fine.

02:30.630 --> 02:32.080
Go on hanging your clothes.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.506
I think you mentioned something about

02:35.530 --> 02:39.410
Yuezhou's Birdcage Swordplay being a swift swordplay?

02:40.120 --> 02:42.376
Do you mean Yuezhou's Liu family's Downpour Swordplay?

02:42.400 --> 02:43.966
- It doesn’t matter what it's called.
- What in the world is Birdcage Swordplay?

02:43.990 --> 02:45.440
What matters are the skills involved.

02:45.660 --> 02:47.416
How can it withstand

02:47.440 --> 02:49.240
the instability of the lower half of the body?

02:50.030 --> 02:51.195
Do you want to learn it?

02:51.219 --> 02:52.669
What do you think?

02:54.650 --> 02:56.816
Yuezhou's Liu family's Downpour Swordplay

02:56.840 --> 02:58.520
has nine moves in total.

02:58.719 --> 03:00.480
For every move,

03:02.400 --> 03:03.816
I’ll charge you ten taels.

03:03.840 --> 03:05.290
What do you think?

03:07.320 --> 03:08.920
Fine, forget it then.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.856
Later on, when Tang Xiao

03:10.880 --> 03:14.076
looks for your Yulan again,

03:14.100 --> 03:15.096
you can deal with it yourself.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.570
Jin. Jin.

03:17.670 --> 03:18.846
I'll go back and write down a copy

03:18.870 --> 03:20.386
of the essentials of swordplay now.

03:20.410 --> 03:21.136
Will that do?

03:21.160 --> 03:22.086
Pack up.

03:22.110 --> 03:23.670
We'll leave in two hours.

03:24.270 --> 03:26.230
Aren't we going back to Nandu tomorrow?

03:28.400 --> 03:29.936
There are Cao Sect's spies everywhere.

03:29.960 --> 03:30.566
If we act according to schedule,

03:30.590 --> 03:32.126
won't that fulfil their wishes?

03:32.150 --> 03:34.030
We've to be unpredictable so we can catch our enemy by surprise.

03:34.270 --> 03:35.940
Miss Shu is doing the right thing.

03:37.240 --> 03:39.136
Bloodshed will be inevitable on our way back.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.240
You must follow the arrangements made by Jin and me.

03:53.380 --> 03:56.290
You've no choice, just pack your wet laundry.

03:56.560 --> 03:58.690
It'll smell sour however you pack it.

03:59.219 --> 04:00.669
Don't insult the sweetness of my beloved clothing.

04:03.440 --> 04:04.950
Are you having a stomachache?

04:05.070 --> 04:10.630
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

04:05.070 --> 04:11.080
[The market price of raw silk is 5 taels and 1 coin. The market price of the deed is 4 taels and 2 coins.]

04:06.600 --> 04:08.920
The deed costs 4 taels and 2 coins.

04:09.210 --> 04:11.190
It’s 9 coins higher than yesterday's price.

04:11.320 --> 04:13.550
The price of raw silk has reduced by 2 coins.

04:14.560 --> 04:16.670
In that case, the deed's price actually

04:17.680 --> 04:19.520
increased by 1 tael and 1 coin.

04:20.870 --> 04:23.460
Miss, what are you calculating?

04:23.800 --> 04:25.800
I’m calculating the probability of the Su family's success.

04:28.480 --> 04:31.240
If the deed follows the loss ratio of raw silk,

04:31.440 --> 04:34.096
deducting one catty by two taels of silver per catty...

04:34.120 --> 04:35.760
40,000 taels?

04:36.680 --> 04:40.680
Then wouldn't 80,000 taels be 360,000 taels of gold?

04:42.330 --> 04:43.416
If I had lost my appetite for days

04:43.440 --> 04:45.439
like you,

04:45.830 --> 04:47.525
I wouldn't have the energy to think about these.

04:47.549 --> 04:50.456
Right now, the fall in the price of raw silk is obvious.

04:50.480 --> 04:52.320
The upward trend of the price of the deed...

04:54.040 --> 04:55.760
There are five days left.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.810
Miss Ke.

04:59.720 --> 05:00.456
Miss Ke.

05:00.480 --> 05:02.500
Chairman Su wants to invite you in.

05:09.530 --> 05:12.380
I heard you are proficient in business.

05:12.670 --> 05:14.096
So, tell me

05:14.120 --> 05:16.760
how much this deed for 80,000 catties of raw silk

05:17.220 --> 05:20.856
can lower the price of Nandu's silk by.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.776
Right now, compared to the deed,

05:22.800 --> 05:25.536
actual goods are more reassuring to the merchants.

05:25.560 --> 05:29.410
So I guess the market price of raw silk will drop.

05:29.890 --> 05:34.280
It could drop down to 4 taels of silver per catty.

05:35.799 --> 05:40.390
I estimate a drop of at most 4 taels and 5 coins.

05:40.600 --> 05:43.660
Chairman Su, have you hedged your bets?

05:43.799 --> 05:45.439
Hedged my bets?

05:45.799 --> 05:47.920
Right now, the deed's price is on a rapid upward trend.

05:48.170 --> 05:50.689
I'm guessing Chairman Su is also involved.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.566
With the solid foundation of the Su family,

05:52.590 --> 05:53.826
if you resell secretly,

05:53.850 --> 05:56.410
it won’t be difficult to earn over 100,000.

05:56.920 --> 05:59.000
If raw silk can’t enter the city

05:59.980 --> 06:01.820
and you need to make compensations,

06:01.880 --> 06:03.656
they will be meager.

06:03.680 --> 06:05.896
Chairman Su is Nandu Chamber of Commerce's supervisor.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.716
The deeds are issued by the Chamber of Commerce.

06:07.740 --> 06:09.896
How could the Su family get involved in embezzlement

06:09.920 --> 06:11.430
by contributing to the rise of the deed's price?

06:12.180 --> 06:13.986
I've overstepped my bounds.

06:14.010 --> 06:15.576
I shouldn't have speculated without authorization.

06:15.600 --> 06:17.920
What Mr. Qian said is true.

06:18.440 --> 06:21.450
Even if I want to do it,

06:21.480 --> 06:23.696
it's not the right thing to do.

06:23.720 --> 06:26.640
Miss Ke is so familiar with business.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.440
I'm really surprised.

06:30.620 --> 06:32.500
I'm flattered, Chairman Su.

06:32.670 --> 06:35.525
My knowledge is shallow.

06:35.549 --> 06:37.930
All right, enough about this.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.720
Miss Ke, dare I ask

06:41.070 --> 06:45.150
what Mr. Yun has been planning recently?

06:48.520 --> 06:51.960
He's not been in Liansheng House lately.

06:55.510 --> 06:56.960
Where did he go?

06:57.070 --> 06:58.416
I don't know either.

06:58.440 --> 06:59.890
It's fine.

07:00.440 --> 07:03.000
Then I'll have to trouble you

07:03.440 --> 07:06.490
to inform me when Mr. Yun returns.

07:11.000 --> 07:12.450
Chairman Su.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.940
This time,

07:15.560 --> 07:19.740
you're placing all your bets on this group of traveling merchants.

07:19.790 --> 07:23.830
[Three days later]

07:40.920 --> 07:42.416
Brother, have some water.

07:42.440 --> 07:43.656
Okay.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.130
Take care of him.

07:49.750 --> 07:51.126
Dear armed escorts,

07:51.150 --> 07:52.146
how are your men?

07:52.170 --> 07:53.856
Most of my men have minor injuries.

07:53.880 --> 07:55.330
One is seriously injured.

07:55.720 --> 07:56.966
It's about the same for me.

07:56.990 --> 07:58.816
Several of my men are killed.

07:58.840 --> 08:01.590
The rest have minor injuries.

08:05.880 --> 08:06.916
Dear armed escorts,

08:06.940 --> 08:08.846
the Su family will make arrangements

08:08.870 --> 08:10.740
for your men and their families.

08:10.800 --> 08:12.386
You've risked your lives helping me.

08:12.410 --> 08:14.170
I will never forget this.

08:38.699 --> 08:40.456
The situation is clear now.

08:40.480 --> 08:42.216
You might as well tell us your identities

08:42.240 --> 08:43.706
and who the mastermind is.

08:43.730 --> 08:45.810
Then, we might spare your lives.

08:46.390 --> 08:48.110
You're not getting anything out of them like that.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.650
Watch and learn.

08:50.480 --> 08:53.840
Which one do you think will give in first?

09:00.120 --> 09:01.570
I think so too.

09:14.670 --> 09:15.876
Do you want to tell me now

09:15.900 --> 09:17.526
or after I beat you up?

09:17.550 --> 09:19.000
I’ll tell you now.

09:19.660 --> 09:22.380
Our villages run errands for those who pay us.

09:22.630 --> 09:23.336
He...

09:23.360 --> 09:24.916
He belongs to Qi Tianfeng's Cao Sect!

09:24.940 --> 09:26.390
He does!

09:26.710 --> 09:28.900
Do you think you’re clean?

09:30.720 --> 09:31.856
How many villages are there

09:31.880 --> 09:33.330
and how many people do you have?

09:33.400 --> 09:36.160
Fifteen villages, about 400 people,

09:36.320 --> 09:38.480
and dozens from Cao Sect.

09:41.650 --> 09:43.180
He's bluffing.

09:43.610 --> 09:46.050
If they had 400 people, why didn't they come together in full force?

09:46.160 --> 09:47.296
Why did they just send a few men?

09:47.320 --> 09:48.850
It's not unusual.

09:49.360 --> 09:51.120
They're just testing the waters.

09:53.760 --> 09:54.886
Miss Shu.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.360
It's unchivalrous to kill those in captive.

09:56.450 --> 09:57.576
If you fall into his hands,

09:57.600 --> 09:59.240
do you think he'll let you go?

10:01.750 --> 10:03.976
Let's keep him as a witness and bring him back to the government office.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.810
You can even use him to convict Qi Tianfeng.

10:06.880 --> 10:08.330
Fine.

10:08.490 --> 10:10.240
We can also use him as a hostage.

10:12.880 --> 10:15.360
For now, lock him up and watch him closely.

10:16.290 --> 10:17.586
Let's go.

10:17.610 --> 10:18.230
No.

10:18.250 --> 10:19.696
Let me go.

10:19.720 --> 10:21.170
Let me go.

10:22.720 --> 10:24.240
Got it?

10:24.320 --> 10:26.086
There's only one way to treat these people.

10:26.110 --> 10:27.560
With ruthlessness.

10:27.860 --> 10:30.270
Since we're like family, the tuition fee is half-price.

10:36.950 --> 10:38.400
Move along.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.150
Put down the knife!

10:50.170 --> 10:51.620
Put down the knife!

10:55.880 --> 10:57.330
Master Qi,

10:57.380 --> 11:00.900
I, Wu Laosan, will be your brother in my next life!

11:10.590 --> 11:12.426
Is this the martial world you've been

11:12.450 --> 11:14.140
dying to explore?

11:18.110 --> 11:19.560
Let's go.

11:49.020 --> 11:50.890
It seems like only ashes are left,

11:52.530 --> 11:54.690
but they're actually marking another beginning.

11:59.400 --> 12:01.280
Chief Armed Escort Wang, you're back.

12:02.990 --> 12:03.736
Mr. Jin.

12:03.760 --> 12:04.696
We're back from exploring the route.

12:04.720 --> 12:05.726
How's the situation?

12:05.750 --> 12:06.816
Look.

12:06.840 --> 12:08.806
The journey tomorrow will be treacherous.

12:08.830 --> 12:10.976
Look here, and here.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.576
These terrains make it easy for ambush.

12:12.600 --> 12:15.086
There are at least seven or eight routes like this.

12:15.110 --> 12:16.386
But we don't have enough men

12:16.410 --> 12:18.050
to break through the defense.

12:18.300 --> 12:19.750
Let me have a look.

12:24.070 --> 12:25.520
Be alert!

12:40.960 --> 12:42.406
He has already used several methods

12:42.430 --> 12:44.456
to deceive us thrice,

12:44.480 --> 12:47.250
in order to make us restless.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.290
What kind of place is this?

12:51.590 --> 12:52.586
It's a deserted relay house.

12:52.610 --> 12:54.616
It's two hours away from here.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.986
Are the exterior walls sturdy?

12:56.010 --> 12:57.006
You'll have to make do with it.

12:57.030 --> 12:59.670
Right now, we're under siege.

12:59.960 --> 13:01.806
They're trying to exhaust us completely

13:01.830 --> 13:03.350
before launching the main offense.

13:03.400 --> 13:04.640
There's no tenable defense position we can take in this wilderness.

13:04.640 --> 13:06.096
There's not a moment when we can be at rest.

13:06.120 --> 13:07.376
At this rate,

13:07.400 --> 13:09.400
their wishes will really come true.

13:09.760 --> 13:10.746
Even if we hide in the relay station,

13:10.770 --> 13:12.340
we're not much stronger.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.010
Miss Shu.

13:14.150 --> 13:15.966
There's only 15 days left on the deed.

13:15.990 --> 13:17.856
We don't have much time left.

13:17.880 --> 13:19.640
Don't worry. We'll make it.

13:20.050 --> 13:20.976
Everyone,

13:21.000 --> 13:22.296
let's stay up for another night.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.916
We'll set off for the relay house at dawn.

13:23.940 --> 13:25.776
Anyway, let's rest and reconsolidate first.

13:25.800 --> 13:27.736
I'll make further arrangements later.

13:27.760 --> 13:29.210
Okay.

13:36.770 --> 13:38.220
Mr. Yun.

13:40.500 --> 13:41.526
Mr. Kang.

13:41.550 --> 13:43.000
Any news?

13:44.400 --> 13:45.756
You've been asking about the news every day.

13:45.780 --> 13:47.340
What are you worried about?

13:47.400 --> 13:49.116
I just find it strange.

13:49.140 --> 13:50.746
Even if something happened to Su’s group of traveling merchants,

13:50.770 --> 13:52.336
someone would still escape and return.

13:52.360 --> 13:54.120
How could there be no news?

13:56.640 --> 13:58.730
You're holding the fishing rod

13:59.110 --> 14:01.540
yet worrying about the bait's safety.

14:02.120 --> 14:03.966
We'll know the outcome very soon.

14:03.990 --> 14:06.110
Please wait a little longer.

14:18.140 --> 14:20.900
[Cao Sect]

14:29.510 --> 14:30.960
Your Master.

14:33.450 --> 14:35.320
I just received a pigeon post.

14:35.730 --> 14:36.816
Su’s group of traveling merchants

14:36.840 --> 14:38.980
is hiding in that relay station now.

14:37.200 --> 14:39.990
[Su’s group of traveling merchants is hiding in that relay station now.]

14:42.360 --> 14:43.810
Your Master.

14:43.880 --> 14:46.640
I think we'll win this time.

14:48.670 --> 14:51.860
It's too early to be sure of success.

14:53.000 --> 14:56.160
Brothers, thank you for braving through dangerous times with us.

14:56.960 --> 15:00.470
Every one will get an additional two seasons of salary.

15:00.600 --> 15:03.240
Those who made contributions will get additional rewards.

15:03.520 --> 15:06.360
In three days, the deed will expire.

15:07.240 --> 15:09.666
Then, we'll secure our position as the leader

15:09.690 --> 15:11.330
of Nandu.

15:11.540 --> 15:14.216
By then, we will no longer be the Cao Sect

15:14.240 --> 15:16.610
that has to walk on eggshells around others.

15:17.970 --> 15:21.010
[Shunyuan Relay Station]

15:28.410 --> 15:29.860
Be careful.

15:33.660 --> 15:35.300
Give me a hand.

15:42.030 --> 15:42.540
Come on.

15:42.560 --> 15:43.426
Put it here.

15:43.450 --> 15:44.900
Be careful.

15:51.760 --> 15:53.210
Here.

15:59.760 --> 16:01.696
Time is tight, and the bandits are strong.

16:01.720 --> 16:03.086
If we just continue to deplete our resources,

16:03.110 --> 16:04.710
we'll only stay at a disadvantage.

16:04.880 --> 16:07.240
So instead of just defending,

16:07.400 --> 16:08.856
why don't we lure the snake out of hiding

16:08.880 --> 16:10.056
by initiating a battle?

16:10.080 --> 16:11.530
Initiate a battle?

16:11.600 --> 16:13.456
There are more than 400 of them.

16:13.480 --> 16:14.926
How many do we have?

16:14.950 --> 16:17.306
And half of us are servants.

16:17.330 --> 16:17.846
Yes.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.846
Once the battle begins,

16:18.870 --> 16:20.216
one of us has to fight against four or five of them.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.596
How can we withstand that?

16:21.620 --> 16:22.856
Right.

16:22.880 --> 16:23.976
Don't rush.

16:24.000 --> 16:25.640
Let Shu finish.

16:26.180 --> 16:27.820
If we're outnumbered,

16:28.200 --> 16:29.830
why don't we separate them into groups

16:29.920 --> 16:31.370
and break through them one by one?

16:32.040 --> 16:33.490
That's exactly what I have in mind.

16:34.140 --> 16:36.440
The first step is to trick them with a fake-out

16:36.010 --> 16:45.800
[Fake-out]

16:36.550 --> 16:39.710
by exchanging the clothing of half of the servants with half of the armed escorts'.

16:39.990 --> 16:42.056
Then, we split our group into two.

16:42.080 --> 16:43.636
It'll seem like we split up accordingly,

16:43.660 --> 16:46.060
but in actuality, one group is full of servants

16:46.130 --> 16:48.240
while the other group is full of armed escorts.

16:49.760 --> 16:52.096
In this case, since our two groups will take separate routes,

16:52.120 --> 16:54.160
our opponents will also have to split up to chase us.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.046
Chief Armed Escort Zheng.

16:55.070 --> 16:55.536
Yes.

16:55.560 --> 16:57.336
You'll be in charge of the servants' group.

16:57.360 --> 16:59.536
Once attacked, abandon the freight wagon immediately,

16:59.560 --> 17:00.786
disperse, and run away.

17:00.810 --> 17:02.260
Understood.

17:02.880 --> 17:04.376
The rest of us

17:04.400 --> 17:06.359
will have to face a tough battle.

17:06.499 --> 17:08.176
Even though it's not one against four,

17:08.200 --> 17:09.920
it's still one against two.

17:09.959 --> 17:11.646
We must finish the battle quickly

17:11.670 --> 17:13.485
before the other group of bandits return and join forces against us.

17:13.509 --> 17:14.725
Since we've been dispatched,

17:14.749 --> 17:17.386
we'll fight with our lives.

17:17.410 --> 17:19.435
Fight with our lives without a second thought.

17:19.459 --> 17:20.576
This is a good strategy.

17:20.600 --> 17:22.560
Be swift and fierce.

17:22.590 --> 17:25.046
Like a strong gust of wind passing through the hills, without a single blade of grass untouched.

17:25.070 --> 17:26.869
Mr. Su, you'll stay at the relay station.

17:28.320 --> 17:29.176
Why?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.646
Let me say it again.

17:30.670 --> 17:32.816
Your main contribution is protecting the raw silk.

17:32.840 --> 17:34.046
You must not go anywhere

17:34.070 --> 17:35.520
and leave the raw silk unattended.

17:39.370 --> 17:41.920
[Shunyuan Relay Station]

18:05.360 --> 18:06.616
Miss Shu.

18:06.640 --> 18:07.836
Yes?

18:07.860 --> 18:09.136
Sure, leave me alone here.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.656
But what if those bandits break in?

18:10.680 --> 18:12.576
- You’re so afraid of death and you want to roam the martial world?
- Alone, how can I...

18:12.600 --> 18:14.160
I’m not afraid of death.

18:15.120 --> 18:17.000
I'm worried about not being able to hold onto the raw silk.

18:18.110 --> 18:19.066
How about this?

18:19.090 --> 18:20.336
I'll go with you.

18:20.360 --> 18:22.520
Adding a person will raise our chances of winning.

18:23.280 --> 18:25.160
Yun Xiang was right about you.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.576
Su Mingyu.

18:26.600 --> 18:28.266
Don't think that I left you here

18:28.290 --> 18:30.060
because I think you're useless.

18:30.220 --> 18:32.230
This place is actually very dangerous.

18:32.300 --> 18:35.610
At present, you're being entrusted with a great responsibility.

18:35.770 --> 18:37.106
But if they break in,

18:37.130 --> 18:38.176
what should I do?

18:38.200 --> 18:39.096
Don't be afraid.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.886
We'll use the "Empty City Ruse".

18:40.910 --> 18:41.936
When we leave,

18:41.960 --> 18:45.000
we'll open up all the main gates of the relay house.

18:45.280 --> 18:46.576
Just stay inside

18:46.600 --> 18:48.050
and don't come out.

18:48.160 --> 18:49.856
But if bandits break in,

18:49.880 --> 18:51.440
just remember one rule.

18:51.520 --> 18:54.330
To take them all down, take their leader down first.

19:54.520 --> 19:56.176
It's been so long and there's no movement at all.

19:56.200 --> 19:57.856
Seems like the "Empty City Ruse" was successful.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.156
Right now, yes.

19:59.180 --> 20:00.730
But we can't be careless.

20:01.080 --> 20:02.036
How about this?

20:02.060 --> 20:03.326
Let's obtain local materials first

20:03.350 --> 20:04.536
and make arrangements in advance.

20:04.560 --> 20:06.096
Okay, I'll listen to you.

20:06.120 --> 20:07.570
Go.

20:11.360 --> 20:13.316
This is superior Nverhong wine from Dingfu Restaurant.

20:13.340 --> 20:14.790
Let's share it.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.600
We could be dead any moment.

20:16.760 --> 20:18.240
It'd be a waste to keep it.

20:20.520 --> 20:21.616
Jin.

20:21.640 --> 20:23.670
Where is Miss Shu from?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.330
Why do you ask?

20:25.800 --> 20:28.496
I've seen many famous young people,

20:28.520 --> 20:30.016
but this is my first time seeing

20:30.040 --> 20:31.720
a strategist like her.

20:31.840 --> 20:33.856
She began roaming the martial world at a young age.

20:33.880 --> 20:36.120
If she wasn't ruthless, she wouldn't have survived until now.

20:36.400 --> 20:39.096
But I've also just found out about

20:39.120 --> 20:40.760
her knowledge on military tactics.

20:41.220 --> 20:43.580
No wonder. Amazing.

20:43.700 --> 20:46.860
In time, she'll surely become famous in the martial world.

21:27.460 --> 21:28.930
Everyone, watch out!

22:43.120 --> 22:45.590
Mr. Su! Mr. Su!

22:45.950 --> 22:46.776
Chief Armed Escort Zheng.

22:46.800 --> 22:47.816
Where are the others?

22:47.840 --> 22:48.766
As instructed, upon attack,

22:48.790 --> 22:50.296
we abandoned the freight wagon and ran away.

22:50.320 --> 22:52.056
But those bandits didn't go back to help the other group.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.856
They came after us instead.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.406
I was afraid all the bandits would be led here,

22:55.430 --> 22:57.230
so I asked everyone to disperse.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.256
How many people were after you?

22:58.280 --> 22:59.546
More than 20.

22:59.570 --> 23:01.020
Finally, it's time.

23:01.210 --> 23:03.036
Close the gates and trap them in.

23:03.060 --> 23:04.640
Don't let anyone escape.

23:12.880 --> 23:15.170
Drag him here!

23:17.610 --> 23:19.060
Get up!

23:21.260 --> 23:22.710
Please don't kill me.

23:23.040 --> 23:24.076
Don't kill me.

23:24.100 --> 23:26.776
How are you an armed escort when you're so afraid of death?

23:26.800 --> 23:28.440
Exactly!

23:31.060 --> 23:32.650
Which Armed Escort Agency are you from?

23:34.470 --> 23:35.716
You're not an armed escort, right?

23:35.740 --> 23:37.376
I'm not.

23:37.400 --> 23:39.390
I'm just a servant.

23:39.780 --> 23:41.230
A servant?

23:47.350 --> 23:48.800
Tell me!

23:48.830 --> 23:50.510
Where is the raw silk?

23:50.600 --> 23:52.080
They're all at the relay station.

24:23.120 --> 24:26.160
Are you Su Mingyu, the Young Master of the Su family?

24:40.720 --> 24:42.260
Interesting.

24:42.290 --> 24:45.220
It's the first time I've seen a small group trapping in a larger group of opponents.

24:46.070 --> 24:47.576
Let's find out

24:47.600 --> 24:50.440
who's really being trapped in today.

24:52.670 --> 24:54.026
Brave warrior,

24:54.050 --> 24:55.750
may I have your name?

24:55.790 --> 24:57.540
What are you up to?

24:57.740 --> 25:00.016
I've robbed countless wealthy people.

25:00.040 --> 25:02.080
No one has ever asked for my name.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.240
According to the martial world's rules,

25:04.330 --> 25:05.686
no matter if we're enemies or friends,

25:05.710 --> 25:07.160
we should know each other's names.

25:13.120 --> 25:15.760
You must have watched too many dramas.

25:15.920 --> 25:18.386
Young Master Su, listen.

25:18.410 --> 25:19.956
We came all the way here

25:19.980 --> 25:22.136
just for raw silk,

25:22.160 --> 25:25.326
not to hold you hostage.

25:25.350 --> 25:27.550
It's out of the question if you want our raw silk.

25:27.720 --> 25:31.440
Surrender now and your lives might be spared.

25:31.990 --> 25:33.276
Keep the raw silk and hostage safe,

25:33.300 --> 25:35.570
and kill off the rest!

25:48.150 --> 25:50.390
He's even a martial artist.

26:16.920 --> 26:19.800
The weirder the weapon, the faster he dies.

26:20.340 --> 26:22.270
You're as blind as a bat!

26:22.640 --> 26:24.310
Do you want to die?

26:50.550 --> 26:52.430
Get them to stop if you want to live.

27:39.600 --> 27:41.050
Mr. Su.

27:41.400 --> 27:42.850
Come with me quickly.

27:44.050 --> 27:46.566
Mr. Su! Mr. Su!

27:46.590 --> 27:47.426
I'm not going anywhere!

27:47.450 --> 27:48.626
Steward Qian repeatedly asked for me

27:48.650 --> 27:49.866
to protect your life

27:49.890 --> 27:51.470
even at the expense of the raw silk.

27:51.800 --> 27:53.830
Raw silk is the lifeblood of our family!

28:51.360 --> 28:53.256
Dear ancestors,

28:53.280 --> 28:54.730
it was my incompetence

28:54.850 --> 28:57.250
that put the Su family

28:58.040 --> 29:01.400
and Mingyu's life in danger.

29:01.470 --> 29:04.006
May the ancestors bless me

29:04.030 --> 29:07.190
so I can draw an auspicious divination stick for our Su family.

29:14.470 --> 29:18.470
The rain has come and gone, and there's still hopes to continue transportation.

29:18.860 --> 29:20.390
The woman is fierce.

29:20.960 --> 29:22.440
The full moon is near,

29:23.400 --> 29:25.200
yet the gentleman continues on. It's dangerous.

29:25.820 --> 29:27.640
This is an ominous divination.

29:29.570 --> 29:31.696
If you persist in your opinions,

29:31.720 --> 29:33.840
I'm afraid there'll be a calamity.

29:34.200 --> 29:35.720
If you want peace,

29:35.750 --> 29:38.870
you must call for a ceasefire.

30:21.300 --> 30:23.666
Zhou. Zhou!

30:23.690 --> 30:25.240
Have you seen Shu?

30:25.760 --> 30:27.210
No.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.330
Shu Yanan!

30:43.360 --> 30:44.810
Shu Yanan!

30:50.560 --> 30:52.010
Shu Yanan!

30:54.240 --> 30:55.690
Shu Yanan!

31:08.840 --> 31:10.290
"Ten Taels of Gold"!

31:11.950 --> 31:13.376
I thought you were dead.

31:13.400 --> 31:13.960
I was thinking about how

31:13.960 --> 31:16.126
Yun Xiang would have to deduct my pay when we go back.

31:16.150 --> 31:17.256
Let's go now.

31:17.280 --> 31:18.016
Where are we going?

31:18.040 --> 31:19.120
Haven't we killed them all?

31:19.120 --> 31:20.536
It's been several hours

31:20.560 --> 31:22.326
but not one bandit has come as reinforcement.

31:22.350 --> 31:24.460
I'm worried that they went directly to the relay house.

31:24.970 --> 31:26.420
Su Mingyu.

31:53.890 --> 31:54.536
Guard the walls!

31:54.560 --> 31:54.790
Yes.

31:54.810 --> 31:55.486
Save whoever you can quickly.

31:55.510 --> 31:55.896
Yes.

31:55.920 --> 31:57.370
Yes.

32:05.560 --> 32:07.010
It's us.

32:08.200 --> 32:10.256
Miss Shu, you're finally here.

32:10.280 --> 32:12.096
We followed the tail end when we retreated.

32:12.120 --> 32:13.696
Two groups of bandits surged in, front and back.

32:13.720 --> 32:14.606
Where is Su Mingyu?

32:14.630 --> 32:15.226
On the second floor.

32:15.250 --> 32:16.700
On the second floor.

32:27.080 --> 32:28.530
Su Mingyu?

32:34.360 --> 32:36.680
Su Mingyu! It's me!

32:37.800 --> 32:39.490
He's killing on autopilot now.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.476
Are you clear-headed now?

33:02.500 --> 33:03.980
Have you regained your senses?

33:04.800 --> 33:06.720
You've sort of had your first kill this time.

33:06.840 --> 33:09.480
Have you counted? How many did you kill?

33:13.090 --> 33:14.690
The flesh was peeled open.

33:16.410 --> 33:19.640
It felt like the sword came to my hand.

33:20.470 --> 33:22.000
Stabbed in until the bones were reached.

33:22.840 --> 33:25.010
It felt like stabbing hard rocks.

33:27.120 --> 33:29.520
The blood is hot when it sprays on your face.

33:31.410 --> 33:32.860
I didn't like it.

33:33.960 --> 33:35.440
Not at all.

33:35.820 --> 33:37.296
This is normal.

33:37.320 --> 33:38.870
You'll be fine after you've regained your senses.

33:41.980 --> 33:43.656
Take a good rest for a while.

33:43.680 --> 33:45.370
Leave everything to us.

34:18.240 --> 34:19.890
They're here again!

34:39.150 --> 34:40.326
Withstand the pressure!

34:40.350 --> 34:41.676
Withstand the pressure!

34:41.700 --> 34:43.510
Go! Go!

34:46.790 --> 34:47.976
We can't withstand the pressure like this!

34:48.000 --> 34:49.720
Hang in there for a while more!

34:51.430 --> 34:52.795
Those who can move, get up!

34:52.819 --> 34:54.126
We must protect the courtyard wall.

34:54.150 --> 34:56.320
Yes.

35:21.350 --> 35:22.880
Withstand the pressure!

35:36.200 --> 35:37.650
The carriage is here!

36:51.350 --> 36:52.800
Have you figured it out?

36:54.730 --> 36:56.320
You're right.

36:56.480 --> 36:58.480
This is the real martial world.

37:00.040 --> 37:03.550
From now on, you are my brother.

37:05.030 --> 37:07.320
The real martial world is full of bloodshed.

37:07.340 --> 37:08.286
You have to kill to live.

37:08.310 --> 37:09.756
Later, when we fight,

37:09.780 --> 37:11.580
don't show any mercy.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.940
Hang in there!

37:19.140 --> 37:20.990
Withstand the pressure!

38:28.160 --> 38:30.320
The lifeblood of my family!
